query
EXPLAIN SELECT pk, ext_only FROM doc_idx
  WHERE body @@ ts_phrase('alpha') AND tag >= 100
  ORDER BY pk;
----
QUERY PLAN
╭─ ORDER_BY ──────────────╮
│ Order By: pk ASC        │
│ ~1 row                  │
╰────────────┬────────────╯
╭─ IRESEARCH_SCAN ────────╮
│ Index: doc_idx          │
│ Lookup: search          │
│ Index Filter:           │
│ ╭─ Term ──────────────╮ │
│ │ Field: body(string) │ │
│ │ Value: alpha        │ │
│ ╰─────────────────────╯ │
│ Projections: pk,        │
│              ext_only   │
│ ~1 row                  │
╰─────────────────────────╯


